{"id":99,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"フィールドワークとWWLで探究する南多摩","feature_description":"東京都立南多摩中等教育学校は「心を拓く・知を極める・体を育む」を掲げ、6年間を通して学びを組み立てます。前期課程では地域学習、ものを素材とした調査研究、科学的検証へと段階的に進むフィールドワークを実施。大学・企業等と連携するWWLも展開し、主体性や課題発見・分析力を育成します。1年は地域学習、2年は身近な「モノ」の調査、3年は科学的検証に取り組み、後期課程では個人研究を論文にまとめます。","clubs":[{"id":1068,"name":"前期陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1070,"name":"前期軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1072,"name":"前期サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1074,"name":"前期女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1076,"name":"前期男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1078,"name":"前期女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1080,"name":"前期硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1083,"name":"前期剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1085,"name":"前期薙刀部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1087,"name":"前期卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":1091,"name":"前期美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/minamitama-s/school_life/activities.ht